[patterns/application/extensions/PTN-APP-EXT-007-entity-framework-extensibility-pattern.md#phase-3-access-patterns-week-5]

#### Phase 3: Access Patterns (Week 5)

7. **Query with Extension Data**:
   ```csharp
   public class CaliforniaProviderService
   {
       private readonly ProductDbContext _productContext;
       private readonly CaliforniaExtensionContext _extensionContext;

       public async Task<ProviderWithExtensions> GetProviderAsync(int id)
       {
           var provider = await _productContext.Providers.FindAsync(id);
           var extension = await _extensionContext.ProviderExtensions.FindAsync(id);

           return new ProviderWithExtensions
           {
               Provider = provider,
               CaliforniaData = extension
           };
       }
   }
   ```

8. **Transactional Updates**:
   ```csharp
   public async Task UpdateProviderWithExtensionAsync(Provider provider, CaliforniaProviderExtension extension)
   {
       using var transaction = await _productContext.Database.BeginTransactionAsync();
       try
       {
           _productContext.Update(provider);
           await _productContext.SaveChangesAsync();

           _extensionContext.Database.UseTransaction(transaction.GetDbTransaction());
           _extensionContext.Update(extension);
           await _extensionContext.SaveChangesAsync();

           await transaction.CommitAsync();
       }
       catch
       {
           await transaction.RollbackAsync();
           throw;
       }
   }
   ```

