### Use Case Scenario: Handling Entity Tracking Conflicts

**Problem**: Both product and extension contexts trying to track same entity.

**Solution**: Detach from product context before extension access:

```csharp
public class ClaimExtensionService
{
    private readonly ProductDbContext _productContext;
    private readonly TexasExtensionContext _extensionContext;

    public async Task UpdateClaimWithExtensionAsync(int claimId, string trackingNumber)
    {
        // Load from product context
        var claim = await _productContext.Claims.FindAsync(claimId);

        // Detach from product context
        _productContext.Entry(claim).State = EntityState.Detached;

        // Attach to extension context
        _extensionContext.Attach(claim);

        // Set shadow property
        _extensionContext.Entry(claim)
            .Property("Ext_TexasTrackingNumber")
            .CurrentValue = trackingNumber;

        // Save with extension context
        await _extensionContext.SaveChangesAsync();
    }
}
```
